    </FONT><FONT STYLE="font-size: 8pt">&nbsp;</FONT><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">of our common stock issuable upon exercise of outstanding
    stock options issued under the 2021 Plan with a weighted average exercise price of $2.99 per share;</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
